WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,590
Fever is gone

2
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,120
It will be very effective if you eat it

3
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,840
Especially if you drink something internally, you can reduce the fever by eating it.

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:07,460
Once the fever goes down, you'll be fine, General

5
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:09,380
This iron code is so new

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,780
Did you get this back?

7
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:13,860
These are the two cars I bought from Winter Paradise. It cost me a lot of money.

8
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,940
It's great to be able to use it now

9
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,740
We are worried that there is no station like this here.

10
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,780
Just ready to use

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,020
It’s more convenient for us to find people around us. Not only that

12
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,340
We can still ride on this iron code to spy on Di Qing and Liu San.

13
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,860
Is it okay for you to take two people to explore the area nearby?

14
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,220
This thing needs to be practiced

15
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,260
Only two now

16
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,940
I'll try to get some more from over there.

17
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,420
But you have to practice these two

18
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,380
Not only do you have to practice

19
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,060
You have to choose a few people to practice with you

20
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,420
Go out on patrol during normal times

21
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,180
Or you can find someone to ride a motorcycle.

22
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,100
But remember

23
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,540
You must ride the iron code back

24
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:42,060
This is our killer brocade, I know it

25
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,180
This is more important than our lives

26
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,580
I'll tell you how to ride

27
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:48,220
Then how to come on, come on, that’s right

28
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:51,530
This is General Youxiao

29
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:54,010
We just picked up six people here, one of them

30
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,570
He said he came from Dushan Mountain, a hundred miles away.

31
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:58,250
About thirty miles away from Dushan Kongbian

32
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,650
At least there are six people in the group

33
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:00,730
Get ready to come to our sandbank
